SUMMARY:The Neon Room at Helium: Orion Levine
LOCATION:Helium Comedy Club\, 1510 SE 9th Ave\, Portland
DESCRIPTION:Orion Levine is a Los Angeles based comedian from the Bay Area.
  Orion has appeared on the Late Late Show with James Corden\, Comedy Centra
 l’s Featuring Series\, was named a New Face at the Just for Laughs Comedy
  Festival in 2022 and was featured on Netflix Radio. He’s also appeared a
 t the New York Comedy Festival\, won SoCal’s Funniest Comic in 2023 and w
 as a finalist at the San Francisco International Comedy Competition in 2021
 . In his Friday night live show “Read The Room” he and a Tarot Card Rea
 der help answer life’s burning questions from audience members and celebr
 ity guests to a sold-out audience. Turns out\, your future is a joke. Orion
  can be seen performing standup all over the country.\n\nManagement reserve
 s the right to prevent customers from entering the facility who they deem d
 isruptive or dangerous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.ap
